  My response to @RealCandaceO:
  I was not at Ft. Huachuca on 9/8 or 9/9. I've never been.
  I was home in Nashville both days. On the afternoon of the 8th, I
  attended an ultrasound with my wife and stopped to get balloons for a
  gender reveal with our son that evening. It's a boy if anyone was
  wondering!
  The following morning, I was at work as usual.
  Here are photos and surveillance footage below to "prove my
  whereabouts."
  Go touch some grass, folks. You are being lied to.
